    "excerpt": "This strategy was designed for BTCUSD in 4H timeframe \u2026 Backtesting context: 2020-01-02 to 2023-01-05 (The strategy has also worked in previous years) \u2026 Once Supertrend changes from a downtrend to a uptrend, you enter into a long position. \u2026 The stop loss will be defined by the atr stop loss \u2026 The first profit will be of 0.75 risk/reward ratio where half position will be closed. \u2026 When this happens, you move the stop loss to break even. \u2026 Once Supertrend changes from a uptrend to a downtrend, you close the other half of the initial long position.",
    "performance_claim": "The strategy has also worked in previous years",
    "verbatim_confidence": "high",
    "notes": "Supertrend flip on BTC 4h with 0.75R partial and breakeven stop; Supertrend/ATR periods not stated (compiler must default). Long side only used for spot."
  },
